# Do not normalise line endings.
#
# Projects 01 and 02 verify the SHA-256 of their input files against
# provenance.json on every run. Any CRLF/LF rewriting by Git would change those
# hashes and make the verifier fail on a fresh clone, so every file is stored
# byte-for-byte as committed.
* -text

*.png binary
*.pdf binary
*.pptx binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.zip binary

# Keep generated artefacts out of diff noise.
*.ipynb -diff
*.html -diff
